he typescript-dev group in /typescript with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/52\n* chore(deps): bump python from `0741d10` to `a2b82f3` in /docker by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/53\n* chore(deps): bump the actions group with 7 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/54\n* docs(extension): explain Chrome's Enhanced Safe Browsing warning by @manjunathshiva in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/55\n* fix(web): keep model files in OPFS when the Cache API refuses them by @manjunathshiva in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/56\n* fix(extension): fail open on a stall, so a video never appears and then vanishes by @manjunathshiva in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/57\n* docs(extension): feed times on an M4 Max and a 16 GB Mac mini by @manjunathshiva in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/58\n* chore: release 0.9.0 by @manjunathshiva in https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/pull/59\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/compare/v0.8.1...v0.9.0","mentions_count":2}